a-5.2","kind":"claim","label":"Lemma 5.2","locator":"Lemma 5.2, Section 5","source_id":"paper","statement":"**Lemma 5.2 (zero-on-grid test; cf. [ABSSW26, Theorem 6.1]).** The zero-on-grid test checks (2) on tables of $A$ and a certificate. It samples uniform $x,L$, reads the bit $a_{\\rm bit}$ of $A$'s table at $(x,L)$ and, with the same $x,L$ and independent seeds, gets $b_0,b_Z$ or rejection from the certificate's local corrector at $(x,0)$ and $(x,Z_H(x))$; it accepts exactly when neither rejects, $b_0=0$ and $b_Z=a_{\\rm bit}$. Under the hypotheses of Theorem 5.1, let $A$ and a proposed certificate $M$ have degree at most $D$, with tables at homogeneous distances $\\delta_A,\\delta_M$ from their encodings. If $A$ does not vanish on $H^k$ and the test rejects with probability $\\kappa$, then (15) holds.","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:0544eb2e356b797914aa8df20ae92a44b0ba8dc80a1f381430efc8a71213a44d/nodes/pcp.lemma-5.2","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:0544eb2e356b797914aa8df20ae92a44b0ba8dc80a1f381430efc8a71213a44d/nodes/pcp.claim-derived-zero","id":"sha256:0544eb2e356b797914aa8df20ae92a44b0ba8dc80a1f381430efc8a71213a44d/edges/%5B%22pcp.claim-derived-zero%22%2C%22pcp.lemma-5.2%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","kind":"supports","record_ref":"sha256:0544eb2e356b797914aa8df20ae92a44b0ba8dc80a1f381430efc8a71213a44d/edges/%5B%22pcp.claim-derived-zero%22%2C%22pcp.lemma-5.2%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","semantic_class":"curated_argument_support","to":"sha256:0544eb2e356b797914aa8df20ae92a44b0ba8dc80a1f381430efc8a71213a44d/nodes/pcp.lemma-5.2"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:0544eb2e356b797914aa8df20ae92a44b0ba8dc80a1f381430efc8a71213a44d/nodes/pcp.lemma-5.2","id":"sha256:0544eb2e356b797914aa8df20ae92a44b0ba8dc80a1f381430efc8a71213a44d/edges/%5B%22pcp.lemma-5.2%22%2C%22lean.PCP.Algebraic.BinaryZeroOnGridCorrection.rejectionRate_lower_bound%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:0544eb2e356b797914a